# auth/

Auth feature stub for ${PROJECT_NAME}. Stamped only when `--with-auth` is set.

Intentionally tiny — no provider wiring, no JWT logic baked in. Replace the placeholder service with your real auth flow (Cognito, Auth0, Clerk, etc.).

## 4-subfolder rule

| Subfolder | What lives here | Naming suffix |
| --- | --- | --- |
| [`components/`](components/) | Login / signup / signed-in shell components | `*.tsx` |
| [`hooks/`](hooks/) | `useAuth`, `useCurrentUser` etc. | `use*.ts` |
| [`services/`](services/) | Token storage, sign-in / sign-out network calls | `*.service.ts` |
| [`types/`](types/) | User / session shapes | `*.types.ts` |

